    "exact_theorem": "For a>b>0 and a fixed proper nested nondegenerate confocal elliptical caustic with primitive least N=2mod4>=6, the signed area of consecutive boundary-tangent intersections times the signed area of their pedal polygon is phase independent for every fixed finite real M. All admitted coprime star windings and reversal; zero or negative pedal area allowed.",
